  "prefLabel": "Mec 102.23 Related instruction",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 102.23 “Related instruction” means an organized and systematic form of instruction designed to provide the apprentice with knowledge of the theoretical and technical subjects related to the apprentice’s occupation.\n\nSource. #13483, eff 1-9-23; #14408, eff 10-17-25",
